### Gossip Collar — Eaten Of Worms

![[Goth Rock — Attachments/Gossip Collar — Eaten Of Worms.jpg]]

*Cover from the official Bandcamp release page, saved locally for reference.*
**Released 4 September 2026 · Full-length · Bat-Cave Productions**
**Direction:** Gothic post-punk / deathrock, Boston
[▶ Bandcamp](https://batcaveproductions.bandcamp.com/album/eaten-of-worms) · [Side-Line coverage](https://www.side-line.com/gossip-collar-eaten-of-worms)
Ten tracks, about 30 minutes — compact and punchy. Recorded and mixed by Marc Valois at Dead Moon Audio, Somerville MA; mastered by Jeff Lipton at Peerless Mastering, Boston. Boston basement-scene band; members previously in The Showcase Showdown, Spitzz and Secret Hearts. Supported by The March Violets, Pink Turns Blue, House of Harm and Fotocrime. CD and LP via the label, digital on Bandcamp.

**Album-number conflict, unresolved:** Side-Line and the discography call this the **third** album (debut 7 April 2023, *Spinning Silk for Parasites* 31 October 2024), while the band's own Instagram called it the "second album" / "sophomore". The discography supports third. Not silently resolved.

